			"notes": "The basic implementation includes the widget-renderer-handler framework implementation of which is easily extensible to fill in the GUI & game-play requirements.\n\nWidget-related members:\n  - Parent & Child widget\n  - Client event listeners\n  - Client-event describing client click\n\nRenderer-related members:\n  - `ScreenRenderer` that have a generic parameter of any subclass of `ScreenRendererHandler`\n\nHandler-related members:\n  - Client and Server handler extending `ScreenRendererHandler of which behaviours are defined by listeners and provider\n  - InventoryHandler\n  - Constrained Slot, for defining slot predicate i.e insertion, removal, and capacity."
